+			/*
+			 * Multi-offset bounded ECAM read test
+			 * (docs/plans/2026-09-13-j81-wifi-pcie.md's "Bounded
+			 * ECAM-window read test: hardware-verified clean"
+			 * section): no MSI domain, no IOMMU. This driver's
+			 * probe() maps only the ECAM window (reg index 0) via
+			 * devm_ioremap_resource() and calls no
+			 * pci_ecam_create()/pci_host_probe() bus-scan code, so
+			 * msi-controller/msi-parent/msi-ranges and
+			 * iommu-map/iommu-map-mask are deliberately omitted --
+			 * iommu-map alone would pull in an of_iommu_configure()
+			 * lookup against dart_apcie1 before probe() even runs,
+			 * which this test needs to avoid to keep DART fully out
+			 * of the picture.
